{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Kick and Hide</strong> is a fast-paced asymmetric first-person multiplayer game for 4-6 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player is a hunter robot that captures rogue robots, while the others try to evade capture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/fc99c725aee36005e44b5571a313e664.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The round starts! <strong>Hiders</strong>\u00a0must rush to\u00a0<strong>break the jail device</strong>, then scatter around the level to <strong>hide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/1cfd7b9e18e592fcaf60096b8e80c086.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/1cfd7b9e18e592fcaf60096b8e80c086.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/1cfd7b9e18e592fcaf60096b8e80c086.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/d2f2c0e817f54c5b1e004b2300a2fbb0.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>seeker</strong> must <strong>find and return the jail's power source</strong>, and then<strong> begin hunting the hiders</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/78d4cb1772f75c51e7ea3fb56968d276.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/78d4cb1772f75c51e7ea3fb56968d276.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/78d4cb1772f75c51e7ea3fb56968d276.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/bf6c3410f593fe4f88510c1df7c7403b.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seeker <strong>captures</strong> hiders by <strong>tagging</strong> them with their gun and <strong>then running to the jail to capture them</strong>. Remaining hiders can\u00a0\u00a0<strong>free everyone by breaking the jail again</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/064792bcb7aa67a604e61310eea5a0af.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/064792bcb7aa67a604e61310eea5a0af.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/064792bcb7aa67a604e61310eea5a0af.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/0d592971ddad70e135b9af3995fca330.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders win by scoring the <strong>most points from breaking the jail</strong>. The seeker wins by <strong>capturing everyone before time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/d6182355230013ff736bb1c170bb9de3.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seeker, you can\u00a0<strong>dash around</strong>, throw <strong>capture grenades</strong>, and use\u00a0<strong>sense</strong>\u00a0to see hiders through walls! As a hider, respond with a <strong>stun grenade</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/f8abb0fe7add9de104b3f1f71f0f345a.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Asymmetric Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powered-up seeker and the less powerful hiders create two completely different gameplay experiences in one game. It's a true test of power vs. wits and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sourcelike movement, Skill-Based Evasion &amp; Map Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders have limited abilities, so winning depends on pure player skill: mastering the movement (bunnyhopping and air strafing), learning level layouts, and coordinating with teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Laughs &amp; Friendly Rivalry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWith fast, ~3-minute rounds and hilarious, unpredictable physics, Kick and Hide is built from the ground up to create memorable moments, epic fails, and heroic plays among friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability, Low Friction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Simple-to-learn rules mean anyone can jump in, but a high skill ceiling in both roles keeps dedicated players coming back for &quot;just one more round.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698510?t=1759738565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698510?t=1759738565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/097d172ae163e69ab5fe4d1ab69f268afd4e4590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759738565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/097d172ae163e69ab5fe4d1ab69f268afd4e4590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759738565","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":