_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/0d592971ddad70e135b9af3995fca330.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders win by scoring the <strong>most points from breaking the jail</strong>. The seeker wins by <strong>capturing everyone before time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/e986badbc8f3a056918049b05e58b3c1.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/d6182355230013ff736bb1c170bb9de3.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seeker, you can\u00a0<strong>dash around</strong>, throw <strong>capture grenades</strong>, and use\u00a0<strong>sense</strong>\u00a0to see hiders through walls! As a hider, respond with a <strong>stun grenade</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.poster.avif?t=1759738565\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.webm?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/88ffdc697ab3d90a29093482534a33e0.mp4?t=1759738565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/f8abb0fe7add9de104b3f1f71f0f345a.avif?t=1759738565\" width=346 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Asymmetric Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powered-up seeker and the less powerful hiders create two completely different gameplay experiences in one game. It's a true test of power vs. wits and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sourcelike movement, Skill-Based Evasion &amp; Map Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders have limited abilities, so winning depends on pure player skill: mastering the movement (bunnyhopping and air strafing), learning level layouts, and coordinating with teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Laughs &amp; Friendly Rivalry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWith fast, ~3-minute rounds and hilarious, unpredictable physics, Kick and Hide is built from the ground up to create memorable moments, epic fails, and heroic plays among friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability, Low Friction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Simple-to-learn rules mean anyone can jump in, but a high skill ceiling in both roles keeps dedicated players coming back for &quot;just one more round.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stolen Heater"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/03be3b9635f7b45eee22f7255547d43b52387332/header